1.1 Generation of Continuous Time Signals
clc;
clear;
close all;
t = -5:0.01:5;
x = sin(2*pi*t);
figure;
plot(t, x, 'LineWidth', 2);
grid on;
title('Continuous Time Sine Signal');
xlabel('Time (seconds)');
ylabel('Amplitude');


1.2 Generation of Discrete Time Signal
clc;
clear;
close all;
n = -10:10;
x = sin(0.2*pi*n);
figure;
stem(n, x, 'filled');
grid on;
title('Discrete Time Sinusoidal Signal');
xlabel('Sample Index (n)');
ylabel('Amplitude');
